# No environment variables required for v1.
# This file is a placeholder so future contributors know where to document env vars.

# --- Contact form (Nodemailer / Gmail SMTP) ---
# Copy .env.example -> .env.local and fill these in. .env.local is gitignored.
# Generate the app password at:
#   Google Account -> Security -> 2-Step Verification -> App passwords
#
# GMAIL_USER=your-address@gmail.com
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-16-char-app-password

# --- Rate limiting (Upstash Redis) ---
# Recommended for production. Without these vars, the /api/contact route
# falls back to an in-process sliding window that is unreliable on
# serverless (each cold instance starts at 0). Provision a free Upstash
# Redis database at https://upstash.com and paste the REST credentials.
#
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=https://your-db.upstash.io
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=your-token